# This file records the expected path for the HuggingFace read token.
# The actual token file is NOT tracked in git (it contains a secret).
#
# On a new machine:
#   1. Obtain a HuggingFace read token from https://huggingface.co/settings/tokens
#   2. Write it to:  ~/.batesste-hugging-face-read-march-2026.token
#   3. The HF_TOKEN_FILE env var (set in .bashrc) will pick it up automatically.
#
# Token path: ~/.batesste-hugging-face-read-march-2026.token
